title: Remove the collation-generation subsystem

doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    The `collation-generation` subsystem is removed and its logic moved to the collator side,
    which already has most of the data needed to build a candidate receipt. Collators now build
    the receipts themselves and send `CollatorProtocolMessage::DistributeSegment` directly to the
    collator protocol, instead of going through `CollationGenerationMessage::SubmitSegment`.

    The legacy `CollatorFn` mechanism of pulling collations out of a callback registered with the
    relay-chain node is removed with it. The adder and undying test collators now drive collation
    generation themselves.

